---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header";
import Footer from "../components/Footer";
---

<Layout 
	title="Privacy Policy | deBackground"
	description="Learn how deBackground protects your privacy by processing all images locally in your browser. Your data never leaves your device."
>
	<main class="min-h-screen bg-background flex flex-col pt-24">
		<Header client:load />
		
		<div class="grow pb-24 px-6 md:px-8">
			<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-8">
				<a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground transition-colors group">
					<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="group-hover:-translate-x-1 transition-transform"><path d="m12 19-7-7 7-7"/><path d="M19 12H5"/></svg>
					Back to Home
				</a>

				<header class="space-y-4">
					<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground">Privacy Policy</h1>
					<p class="text-muted-foreground">Last updated: January 2026</p>
				</header>

				<section class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none space-y-8 text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
					<div class="space-y-4">
						<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">1. Privacy First Philosophy</h2>
						<p>
							deBackground is built with a "Privacy First" philosophy. Unlike traditional background removal services 
							that upload your photos to a server, deBackground processes everything **entirely on your device**.
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="space-y-4">
						<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">2. Data Collection</h2>
						<p>
							We do **not** collect, store, or transmit your images. Your photos never leave your computer. 
							Because processing happens locally in your browser using WebAssembly and Web Workers, we have 
							no access to your visual data.
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="space-y-4">
						<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">3. Tracking & Analytics</h2>
						<p>
							We do not use invasive tracking or third-party analytics that profile you. We may use minimal, 
							anonymous technical logs to improve the performance of our local AI models, but these never 
							contain personal information or image data.
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="space-y-4">
						<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">4. Local Storage</h2>
						<p>
							The application may use your browser's local storage or indexedDB to cache AI models for 
							faster subsequent loads. This data stays on your machine and can be cleared at any time 
							via your browser settings.
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="space-y-4">
						<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">5. Contact</h2>
						<p>
							If you have questions about our privacy approach, please reach out via our GitHub repository.
						</p>
					</div>
				</section>
			</div>
		</div>

		<Footer />
	</main>
</Layout>
